#  `for` vs `while`

| Feature               | `for` Loop                    | `while` Loop                       |
| --------------------- | ----------------------------- | ---------------------------------- |
| Best used when        | Number of iterations is known | Condition controls repetition      |
| Works with            | Sequences and ranges          | Boolean conditions                 |
| Common use            | Lists, strings, ranges        | User input, conditional repetition |
| Risk of infinite loop | Low                           | Higher if condition isn't updated  |

